<title>USA: Mont Belvieu, Texas won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Mont Belvieu, Texas won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $12 million of Mont Belvieu, Texas, general obligation bonds series 1996B, with a true interest cost of 5.52 percent.</p>
